<event name="Team Vs Team" xmlns:xsi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance" xsi:noNamespaceSchemaLocation="../../../../xsd/event.xsd">
	<!-- 
		The rrule attribute is an RFC 5545 recurrence rule for the start time of the event, in the server time zone.
		- FREQ=DAILY;BYHOUR=20;BYMINUTE=0 runs at 20:00 every day.
		- FREQ=WEEKLY;BYDAY=SA,SU;BYHOUR=18;BYMINUTE=30 runs at 18:30 every Saturday and Sunday.
		- FREQ=DAILY;BYHOUR=0,4,8,12,16,20;BYMINUTE=0 runs every 4 hours, on the hour.
		Set BYMINUTE, and BYHOUR for daily or longer rules; COUNT and INTERVAL are not supported (the rule has no fixed start date).
		You can use multiple schedule elements.
	-->
